OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from this year's Proms
OL,13,     Fincluding Mahler's 6th Symphony
OL,14,     Ffrom the BBC Symphony Orchestra
OL,15,     Fplus recordings from the recent
OL,16,     F2026 Aldeburgh Festival.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,18,     F2/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,19,     Fearly years of Smith's marriage to
OL,20,     Fa lawyer, Frederick Meadows White.
