OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FKatie welcomes Carolin Widmann to
OL,7,     FIn Tune. Phelim McDermott on
OL,8,     Fdirecting Tao of Glass.
OL,9,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,10,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the BBC
OL,11,     FSymphony Orchestra conducted by
OL,12,     FSakari Oramo in Sibelius's
OL,13,     FSymphony No.2, Turnage's Festen
OL,14,     FSuite, and, with Guy Johnston,
OL,15,     FBritten's Cello Symphony.
OL,16,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,17,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,18,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,19,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,20,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,21,     Feverything in between.
